    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>The Tale of Relm</strong> \ud83c\udf1f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A captivating, story-rich JRPG adventure</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/acedbcfcac335047816cb48af938a23a.poster.avif?t=1752603425\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/acedbcfcac335047816cb48af938a23a.webm?t=1752603425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/acedbcfcac335047816cb48af938a23a.mp4?t=1752603425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tale of Relm is a <strong>captivating, story-rich JRPG</strong> that combines <strong>classic turn-based mechanics</strong> with <strong>strategic depth</strong>, offering players an <strong>immersive experience</strong> set in a <strong>richly detailed, handcrafted world</strong>. As you journey through diverse landscapes, you'll <strong>uncover hidden secrets</strong> and <strong>solve intricate puzzles</strong> reminiscent of early <strong>Zelda</strong> games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>A Cast of 10 Unique Heroes</strong><br>At the heart of the game lies a <strong>compelling story</strong> that unfolds through the experiences of <strong>10 unique playable characters</strong>, each with their own <strong>backstory</strong>, <strong>abilities</strong>, and <strong>strengths</strong>. <strong>Expressive, hand-drawn character busts</strong> bring these characters to life, adding <strong>emotional depth</strong> and making the <strong>dialogue more immersive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Strategic, Turn-Based Combat</strong><br>The Tale of Relm's <strong>strategic combat system</strong> emphasizes <strong>careful planning</strong> and <strong>rewards</strong> you for discovering <strong>enemy weaknesses</strong> and <strong>breaking their shields</strong> before delivering the final blow. With <strong>over 200 unique enemies</strong>, each with <strong>distinct behaviors and strategies</strong>, every fight presents a <strong>new challenge</strong>.<br>Unlike some traditional JRPGs, there are <strong>no random encounters</strong>; <strong>enemies are visible</strong> on the map, allowing you to <strong>choose when and how to engage</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/f5111926267b8b0f8e904e1a3f39bb0f.poster.avif?t=1752603425\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/f5111926267b8b0f8e904e1a3f39bb0f.webm?t=1752603425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/f5111926267b8b0f8e904e1a3f39bb0f.mp4?t=1752603425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f <strong>Explore, Discover, and Interact</strong><br>As you explore the game\u2019s world, you\u2019ll find yourself drawn into its story through <strong>interactions with villagers</strong>, <strong>exploration of its villages</strong>, and the <strong>mysteries</strong> that lie hidden within its landscapes. <strong>Shops</strong> offer <strong>weapons and armor</strong>, each with its own <strong>strengths and weaknesses</strong>, while <strong>random villagers</strong> may provide <strong>useful tips or hints</strong>, further enriching the <strong>narrative experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Flexible Character Progression</strong><br>The game also offers a <strong>flexible skill acquisition system</strong>, allowing you to <strong>customize your characters</strong> by obtaining <strong>skills in any order</strong> through a <strong>job point system</strong>. This flexibility enables <strong>unique and varied builds</strong>, giving you control over <strong>how your characters evolve</strong> throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Tactical Boss Encounters</strong><br><strong>Strategic boss battles</strong> are another highlight, with each boss having a <strong>perfect strategy waiting to be uncovered</strong>. Success in these battles requires <strong>careful observation</strong>, <strong>tactical thinking</strong>, and a <strong>deep understanding</strong> of the game's mechanics, all within the context of its <strong>unfolding story</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Your Epic Journey Awaits</strong><br>Embark on an <strong>epic, story-rich journey</strong> filled with <strong>strategy, exploration, and discovery</strong> in <strong>The Tale of Relm</strong>, where <strong>every decision shapes your adventure</strong> and the <strong>narrative pulls you deeper</strong> into its world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>The Tale of Relm</strong> \ud83c\udf1f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A captivating, story-rich JRPG adventure</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/acedbcfcac335047816cb48af938a23a.poster.avif?t=1752603425\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/acedbcfcac335047816cb48af938a23a.webm?t=1752603425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/acedbcfcac335047816cb48af938a23a.mp4?t=1752603425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tale of Relm is a <strong>captivating, story-rich JRPG</strong> that combines <strong>classic turn-based mechanics</strong> with <strong>strategic depth</strong>, offering players an <strong>immersive experience</strong> set in a <strong>richly detailed, handcrafted world</strong>. As you journey through diverse landscapes, you'll <strong>uncover hidden secrets</strong> and <strong>solve intricate puzzles</strong> reminiscent of early <strong>Zelda</strong> games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>A Cast of 10 Unique Heroes</strong><br>At the heart of the game lies a <strong>compelling story</strong> that unfolds through the experiences of <strong>10 unique playable characters</strong>, each with their own <strong>backstory</strong>, <strong>abilities</strong>, and <strong>strengths</strong>. <strong>Expressive, hand-drawn character busts</strong> bring these characters to life, adding <strong>emotional depth</strong> and making the <strong>dialogue more immersive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Strategic, Turn-Based Combat</strong><br>The Tale of Relm's <strong>strategic combat system</strong> emphasizes <strong>careful planning</strong> and <strong>rewards</strong> you for discovering <strong>enemy weaknesses</strong> and <strong>breaking their shields</strong> before delivering the final blow. With <strong>over 200 unique enemies</strong>, each with <strong>distinct behaviors and strategies</strong>, every fight presents a <strong>new challenge</strong>.<br>Unlike some traditional JRPGs, there are <strong>no random encounters</strong>; <strong>enemies are visible</strong> on the map, allowing you to <strong>choose when and how to engage</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/f5111926267b8b0f8e904e1a3f39bb0f.poster.avif?t=1752603425\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/f5111926267b8b0f8e904e1a3f39bb0f.webm?t=1752603425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/f5111926267b8b0f8e904e1a3f39bb0f.mp4?t=1752603425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f <strong>Explore, Discover, and Interact</strong><br>As you explore the game\u2019s world, you\u2019ll find yourself drawn into its story through <strong>interactions with villagers</strong>, <strong>exploration of its villages</strong>, and the <strong>mysteries</strong> that lie hidden within its landscapes. <strong>Shops</strong> offer <strong>weapons and armor</strong>, each with its own <strong>strengths and weaknesses</strong>, while <strong>random villagers</strong> may provide <strong>useful tips or hints</strong>, further enriching the <strong>narrative experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Flexible Character Progression</strong><br>The game also offers a <strong>flexible skill acquisition system</strong>, allowing you to <strong>customize your characters</strong> by obtaining <strong>skills in any order</strong> through a <strong>job point system</strong>. This flexibility enables <strong>unique and varied builds</strong>, giving you control over <strong>how your characters evolve</strong> throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Tactical Boss Encounters</strong><br><strong>Strategic boss battles</strong> are another highlight, with each boss having a <strong>perfect strategy waiting to be uncovered</strong>. Success in these battles requires <strong>careful observation</strong>, <strong>tactical thinking</strong>, and a <strong>deep understanding</strong> of the game's mechanics, all within the context of its <strong>unfolding story</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Your Epic Journey Awaits</strong><br>Embark on an <strong>epic, story-rich journey</strong> filled with <strong>strategy, exploration, and discovery</strong> in <strong>The Tale of Relm</strong>, where <strong>every decision shapes your adventure</strong> and the <strong>narrative pulls you deeper</strong> into its world.</p>",
